        <pb n="266"/>
        <head>Another for every day.</head>
        <head>220 — x.</head>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="1">When we receive the living body and precious blood of<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/> the only Word and Son, let us all offer praise to him [and sing<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/>, <quote>Halleluyah!</quote></ab>
        </div>
      </div>
